---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import Container from '../components/Container.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Jeremy Hoover">
  <Container>
    <section class="about">
      <h1>a bit about me</h1>
      <p>
        When I was in my late teens, done highschool and ready for the world, I was at a point where
        I was not yet sure what I would want to do with my life. I worked at a local store, when
        morning, a couple of managers were working on the store layout, strategizing of how to face
        products and position items to make the best experience for customers. A light went off
        inside. I went straight to the highschool guidance counsellor and told her that I wanted to
        pursue “Design”, which in ’98 she pushed me on to Graphic Design. I had a background in art,
        so it seemed to make sense. I signed up for college and after a couple years, one summer I
        took a design job and never went back.
      </p>
      <p>
        This was the late early 2000’s now, a whole new century! I was quick to move from print to
        web, it was just a much better opportunity. After several years, I decided it was time to
        “break out on my own”, quit the day job and work freelance from my basement full time. This
        lasted 6 months, my first son came into the world and it was time for me to go back to
        office work. I took a job at a small, but quite talented marketing company, where I got to <a
          href="https://www.compasscreative.ca"
          target="_blank">work</a
        >
        <a href="https://reinink.ca" target="_blank">with</a>
        <a href="https://onefiftythreestudio.com" target="_blank">some</a>
        <a href="https://capturestudio.ca" target="_blank">great</a>
        <a href="https://jasonbouwman.com" target="_blank">people</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today, I’m a dad to two special boys and married to a sweetheart of a lady. When I’m not at
        work, I enjoy playing acoustic guitar, growing vegetables in my backyard garden and hiking
        the trails around my city.
      </p>
      <p>
        By day, I work as a front-end developer at a growing <a
          href="https://agencyanalytics.com"
          target="_blank">Toronto based SaaS company</a
        >. I haven’t worked on the marketing website for a couple versions, but my work is focused
        on helping new customers quickly learn the product and see it’s value.
      </p>
      <p>
        I‘m always interested in talking about new opportunities, if you would like to work on a
        project together, please <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </Container>
</BaseLayout>
